@startuml
@startuml

salt
{
  <b>ORE STUDIO - SYSTEM ADMINISTRATION: TENANTS</b>
  --
  <b>ACME CORPORATION</b> | [ Act in this tenant ] | [ Back to tenants ]
  --
  Details and setup as in See one tenant.
  To read the tenant's parties, accounts and sign-ins, act in the tenant.
  --
  ==
  <b>INSIDE THE TENANT</b>
  ==
  {+
    Acting in Acme Corporation as admin | [ Leave ]
  }
  --
  <b>ORE STUDIO - TENANT ADMINISTRATION: ACME CORPORATION</b>
  --
  <b>PARTIES</b>
  --
  {#
    Code | Name | Category | Type | Status | Parent
    acme_corporation_system | System Party | System | Internal | Active | -
    ACMCOR | Acme Corporation Plc | Operational | Corporate | Active | -
    ACCOUK | ACME Corporation UK plc | Operational | Corporate | Active | Acme Corporation Plc
  }
  {
    Showing 1-3 of 5 parties | [Previous] | [Next]
  }
  --
  Read-only: the tenant session carries read permissions only.
  Leaving returns to system administration on this tenant's screen.
}

@enduml
